    "referrals": [
      "POL-NS-01(d): driver-education — the driver terminated this pickup under cancellation_reason_code DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE, which is none of the three codes limb (d) recognises (RIDER_NO_SHOW, RIDER_UNREACHABLE, EXCESSIVE_WAIT). Review the driver's reason-code selection; no adverse finding is made against the rider."
    ],
    "confidence": 0.95,
    "explanation": "To the rider and the driver: the SGD 4.50 cancellation charge does not stand. It is refunded in full to the rider, and no driver compensation is payable.\n\nWHY THE CHARGE FALLS. POL-NS-01 is conjunctive — all four limbs must hold or the fee is not chargeable. Limbs (a) to (c) are satisfied on this record: the trip record (EV-TRIP-02723) carries the driver's 'I'm Here' event at 11:59:59, and the GPS trace (EV-GPS-02723) places the driver inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius in a single continuous run of 39 qualifying fixes lasting 380 s, from 11:59:59 to 12:06:19 — longer than the 180 s free waiting period carried by trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec, with no_show_threshold_sec null. Limb (d) is not satisfied: the trip was terminated by the driver at 12:06:23 under cancellation_reason_code DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE, which is not one of RIDER_NO_SHOW, RIDER_UNREACHABLE or EXCESSIVE_WAIT. POL-NS-01 states in terms that DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE is the driver's own admission that he could not find the rider and does not satisfy limb (d); the driver's counterparty statement ('Could not locate the rider so I cancelled') says the same. Because the driver's stationary fixes lie INSIDE the arrival radius, POL-NS-01's in-radius DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE outcome applies: the fee is not chargeable, the ruling is FULL_REFUND of the cancellation fee with no driver compensation, and the mis-selected reason code is recorded in the referrals as a driver-education item.\n\nINDEPENDENT SECOND GROUND. POL-NS-04 also exonerates the rider and requires a full refund with no driver compensation. Limb (a): the rider sent 'at the lift lobby' at 12:00:59, inside the waiting window, a locating message (EV-CHAT-02723). Limb (b): the driver posted no reply within 120 s of it and trip_record.in_app_calls is empty, so no in-app call was placed either. Limb (c): the rider's own track (EV-GPS-02723) puts her within about 15.5 m of the pin for 67 of 67 qualifying fixes, well inside the 100 m STANDARD rider-presence radius. All three limbs hold.\n\nDRIVER CLAIMS, ANSWERED TOGETHER. The driver's factual claims are accepted: that he reached the pin (39 consecutive in-radius fixes), that he held 380 s against a 180 s minimum, that his 11:59:59 marker was not a false arrival under POL-NS-05 (min distance 0 m and speed 0.0 km/h at that timestamp, so neither trigger — over 300 m from the pin, or 15 km/h or more — fires, and no POL-NS-05(ii) false-arrival referral arises), that POL-NS-06 opens no route to a refund (there is no shortfall), and that POL-NS-08(d) is not engaged (the SGD 4.50 line reconciles with platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd of SGD 4.50, ledger difference SGD 0.00). None of that cures limb (d). The driver's request for SGD 3.60 under POL-NS-07 is rejected: POL-NS-07 pays only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full, and it is not. The anti-farming test (driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d 0 against completed_trips_30d 114) is therefore never reached and is not tripped. The driver's own point that this was a reason-code labelling error rather than rider misconduct is accepted, and it is what produces the referral; but for a DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE termination in which the fixes lie inside the radius, the label is the very thing that makes the fee unchargeable. driver_profile.prior_no_show_flags (2) is a lifetime counter and context only under POL-GEN-01; it is not used in either direction.\n\nAMOUNT. The contested sum is the cancellation-fee line, SGD 4.50 (EV-FARE-02723: total_charged 4.50, payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00; platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd 4.50). No booking or platform fee is added. The monetary effect, SGD 4.50, is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of SGD 8.00, so it executes automatically; the driver payment field is null.\n\nCONFIDENCE. The deciding facts are carried by EV-TRIP-02723, EV-GPS-02723 and EV-CHAT-02723, each at weight_multiplier 1.0. The only impaired artifact, EV-ADVIS-02723-01 (TRAFFIC_ADVISORY, MISSING, weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT), carries no deciding fact — it is cited only for its absence, and POL-NS-06(i) accumulation is not asserted against it — so no POL-NS-08 impairment caps this ruling and no POL-NS-09(e) escalation is engaged. Confidence 0.95, above the 0.70 floor."
  },
